OL,3,GNEWSALane closures for further M62 Ouse
OL,4,ABridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being warned about lane
OL,7,Fclosures over the weekend and early
OL,8,Fnext week on the M62 Ouse Bridge.
OL,10,FA damaged joint was found on Tuesday,
OL,11,Fand further investigations found four
OL,12,Fadditional joints that needed
OL,13,Frepairing, even though they were all
OL,14,Frecently replaced during a lengthy
OL,15,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
