OL,3,GNEWSALane closures for further M62 Ouse
OL,4,ABridge repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said work on the
OL,7,Fbridge near Goole, East Yorkshire,
OL,8,Fwould take place over five nights,
OL,9,Fbetween 20:00 and 06:00 BST. Repairs
OL,10,Fare planned on the eastbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway overnight on Friday and
OL,12,FSaturday, with westbound work taking
OL,13,Fplace on Sunday, Monday and Tuesday
OL,14,Fnights.
OL,16,FThe carriageways will have just one
OL,17,Flane open during the overnight work and
OL,18,Ftwo lanes open during the day.
